flowchart LR
  PM[产品经理] --> Chat[会话定义候选验收场景]
  Chat --> Pi[Pi Agent]
  Pi --> Gateway[模式与权限网关]
  Gateway --> Spec[工作空间用例定义与修订]
  PM --> Confirm[确认当前验收范围]
  Confirm --> Spec
  Preview[HTML 成果预览] --> Run[执行原型验收]
  Gateway --> Run
  Spec --> Run
  Files[已授权成果与来源] --> Snapshot[宿主不可变快照与哈希]
  Snapshot --> Run
  Run --> Browser[隔离浏览器：固定操作与断言]
  Browser --> Evidence[宿主结果与截图]
  Evidence --> Quality[既有 QualityReport 仓库]
  Files --> Freshness[重新核对版本与权限]
  Spec --> Freshness
  Quality --> Freshness
  Freshness --> Preview
  Preview -->|失败证据| Chat
  Freshness --> Gate[现有交付门禁]
  Confirm --> Gate
  Gate --> Delivery[绑定版本的交付]
